    <string name="about_desc">A clean, private, ad-free comic &amp; PDF reader. Opens images, ZIP/CBZ, RAR/CBR, 7z/CB7 and PDF — entirely offline.</string>
    <string name="about_credits">Archive support by junrar and Apache Commons Compress. PDF rendering via the Android platform PdfRenderer. Icons by Material Symbols.</string>
    <string name="about_tagline">Read without the noise.</string>
    <string name="about_license">Free and open source software, released under the MIT License.</string>

